  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biomass to Power, through Recast Energy LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant Village Corps Ghana Limited partially funds a feasibility study to assess the viability of a proposed twenty megawatt power plant just north of Nsawam, in the Eastern Region of Ghana, fueled with a mix of cultivated giant bamboo and existing biomass resources. The feasibility study is performed on a sole source basis by the U.S. firm, Recast Energy, LLC.</narrative>
  </description>
